---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Docs" description="Documentation for uap-analyzer — quickstart, architecture, deployment.">

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">

    <section class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
        <span class="stamp text-accent">// DOCS</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight text-text">Documentation</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl prose-body">
        From "what is this thing" to "running it on your LAN against a fresh war.gov tranche."
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <a href="/docs/quickstart" class="block bg-panel rounded-sm p-5 border border-border no-underline hover:border-accent transition group">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-muted mb-2 tracking-widest group-hover:text-accent">// START HERE</p>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-text font-mono">Quickstart</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed m-0 prose-body">
          Get the container running, point it at a corpus, register with Claude Code, call the first tool.
        </p>
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/architecture" class="block bg-panel rounded-sm p-5 border border-border no-underline hover:border-accent-green transition group">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-muted mb-2 tracking-widest group-hover:text-accent-green">// FOUNDATIONS</p>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-text font-mono">Architecture</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed m-0 prose-body">
          Container + ollama + corpus bind-mount + SQLite/FTS5 cache. The shape of the box.
        </p>
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/deployment" class="block bg-panel rounded-sm p-5 border border-border no-underline hover:border-warm transition group">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-muted mb-2 tracking-widest group-hover:text-warm">// OPERATIONS</p>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-text font-mono">Deployment</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed m-0 prose-body">
          Docker compose, bootstrap script, the FastMCP transport-security gotcha you'll hit on first run.
        </p>
      </a>
    </section>

  </div>

</Base>
